# home-music-time: where in the song, as Spotify draws it (a6443): the time passed, a thin bar, the length. The words are one moment (the song's end) and its whole, from witnessed:media's `at`: the painter moves the bar and the time each second from its own clock, so nothing is rebuilt while the song plays on. Placed by home-music and home-music-full; not drawn when the app gives no length.
time : column
  of witnessed:media as m
  each timerow
timerow : row
  role mutime
  only when ($m.at or "") != ""
  now : text "$m.at"
    live since
    role mutimenum
  bar : column
    share 1
    role mubarbox
    fill : text "$m.at"
      live until bar
      role mubar
      role mubar.on when $m.playing = "yes"
  length : text "$m.length"
    role mutimenum
